    {
      "Id": "cell-chart2d-code",
      "Type": 0,
      "Language": "csharp",
      "Source": "// Multi-series Fourier harmonic wave decomposition\nvar t = Enumerable.Range(0, 100).Select(i =\u003E i * 2.0 * Math.PI / 100.0).ToArray();\nvar fundamental = t.Select(Math.Sin).ToArray();\nvar harmonic3 = t.Select(x =\u003E (1.0 / 3.0) * Math.Sin(3 * x)).ToArray();\nvar composite = t.Select(x =\u003E Math.Sin(x) \u002B (1.0 / 3.0) * Math.Sin(3 * x) \u002B (1.0 / 5.0) * Math.Sin(5 * x)).ToArray();\n\nDisplay.LineChart(\n    (\u0022Fundamental (sin t)\u0022, fundamental),\n    (\u00223rd Harmonic (1/3 sin 3t)\u0022, harmonic3),\n    (\u0022Composite Square Wave\u0022, composite));\n\nConsole.WriteLine(\u0022\u2713 2D Multi-series harmonic decomposition rendered.\u0022);",
      "OutputText": "\u2713 2D Multi-series harmonic decomposition rendered.\n",
      "ExecutionCount": 2,
      "IsExecuting": false,
      "ExecutionTimeText": "156 ms",
      "HasError": false,
      "IsMarkdownPreviewMode": false,
      "IsInputCollapsed": false,
      "IsOutputCollapsed": false,
