    {
      "Id": "cell-plot3d-code",
      "Type": 0,
      "Language": "csharp",
      "Source": "// 3D Sombrero surface wave: z = sin(r) / r\nDisplay.Plot3D((x, y) =\u003E {\n    double r = Math.Sqrt(x * x \u002B y * y);\n    return r == 0 ? 1.0 : Math.Sin(r) / r;\n}, (-6.0, 6.0), (-6.0, 6.0), resolution: 28, title: \u0022Sombrero Wave Surface (z = sin(r) / r)\u0022);\n\nConsole.WriteLine(\u0022\u2713 3D Parametric surface mesh rendered.\u0022);",
      "OutputText": "\u2713 3D Parametric surface mesh rendered.\n",
